cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use cffLaTeX, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "cffLaTeX: Import Citation File Format metadata into LaTeX"
abstract: >-
  cffLaTeX reads the title, abstract, and authors of a citation from a Citation
  File Format (CFF) file, such as the CITATION.cff file of a research software
  repository, into a LaTeX document, so that the metadata is written only once.
authors:
  - family-names: Song
    given-names: Jisoo
repository-code: https://github.com/JSS95/cfflatex
license: MIT
keywords:
  - LaTeX
  - Citation File Format
  - metadata
